(3110870, 437724, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the position of the moon centered. I know how DPCers are though and there''ll probably be comments about it in the negative but I like it. Overall I like the photo and the title ties it in to the challenge (power for sale). 7</td>', 'I like the position of the moon centered. I know how DPCers are though and there''ll probably be comments about it in the negative but I like it. Overall I like the photo and the title ties it in to the challenge (power for sale). 7', '2006-12-13 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110953, 436460, 66398, '<td valign="top">I would love this with just the Church and the sun above it. That part is beautiful. I don''t like the power lines running across the photo but that is probably not something you can change. Overall I like this photo. It was well done. 6<br/>BTW Your salvation has already been paid for and it cost quite a bit more than a dollar. Tithe isn''t a way to pay for it so the money you put into the offering plate doesn''t pay for it either and it should be 10% of your income (I''m sure that''s more than ten dollars).</td>', 'I would love this with just the Church and the sun above it. That part is beautiful. I don''t like the power lines running across the photo but that is probably not something you can change. Overall I like this photo. It was well done. 6BTW Your salvation has already been paid for and it cost quite a bit more than a dollar. Tithe isn''t a way to pay for it so the money you put into the offering plate doesn''t pay for it either and it should be 10% of your income (I''m sure that''s more than ten dollars).', '2006-12-13 00:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
