(3110992, 437886, 54728, '<td valign="top">Reflection detracts from the photo.  Also, it seems crooked.  Could be fixed by rotating to the right.  Unless you made it crooked on purpose.</td>', 'Reflection detracts from the photo.  Also, it seems crooked.  Could be fixed by rotating to the right.  Unless you made it crooked on purpose.', '2006-12-13 00:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3111007, 436022, 66635, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.  I think it would be better if she were looking at the art rather than at the camera because, as it is, it gives the impression that it is a picture of a woman and a dog posing near some art, rather than a picture depicting something "For Sale."  Nice picture, though.</td>', 'Love the colors.  I think it would be better if she were looking at the art rather than at the camera because, as it is, it gives the impression that it is a picture of a woman and a dog posing near some art, rather than a picture depicting something "For Sale."  Nice picture, though.', '2006-12-13 00:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3111014, 437620, 54728, '<td valign="top">hum...and there just happened to be a one-legged guy walking by.  interesting.  Nice clarity, I like the shiny street.  Maybe a closer look and the fish, a lower angle with a focus on a vendor or a customer might have been more concentrated, instead of scattering the focus on lots of details.</td>', 'hum...and there just happened to be a one-legged guy walking by.  interesting.  Nice clarity, I like the shiny street.  Maybe a closer look and the fish, a lower angle with a focus on a vendor or a customer might have been more concentrated, instead of scattering the focus on lots of details.', '2006-12-13 00:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3111022, 437330, 66635, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Nice colors and I like the narrow depth of field.</td>', 'I like this.  Nice colors and I like the narrow depth of field.', '2006-12-13 00:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
