(3111029, 437890, 66398, '<td valign="top">Too cute. This was sort of the idea I had and didn''t do. I wanted to find one of those kids outside a grocery store with a cardboard box of kittens or puppies and a for sale sign (then I could decide which challenge to enter it in. Never got out and looked for em and probably wouldn''t have found em anyhow. But yours gets an 8 from me because this is cute. I like how you got the tooth actually ripping the sign.</td>', 'Too cute. This was sort of the idea I had and didn''t do. I wanted to find one of those kids outside a grocery store with a cardboard box of kittens or puppies and a for sale sign (then I could decide which challenge to enter it in. Never got out and looked for em and probably wouldn''t have found em anyhow. But yours gets an 8 from me because this is cute. I like how you got the tooth actually ripping the sign.', '2006-12-13 00:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3111030, 437905, 66635, '<td valign="top">Now this is great.  Possible ribbon.</td>', 'Now this is great.  Possible ribbon.', '2006-12-13 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
