(3111411, 438025, 66635, '<td valign="top">Bonus points just because it''s "In-n-Out."  I sooo miss that place.  Can you mail me a double double with cheese, fries and a chocolate shake, pleeeeaaaasee!</td>', 'Bonus points just because it''s "In-n-Out."  I sooo miss that place.  Can you mail me a double double with cheese, fries and a chocolate shake, pleeeeaaaasee!', '2006-12-13 01:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3111416, 438025, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gawd, I miss In ''n Out! The single thing I miss most about California... I wish the tilt on this were not so extreme, and that the burger had a little breathing room on the left. Also, there''s an unfortunate tangence between the rim of the cup and the top of the divider that could have been avoided to great benefit. The color balance and tones are spot-on, and that wasn''t easy to do. It''s crisp and dynamic, which is good. Goof luck with it, I like it!</td>', 'Gawd, I miss In ''n Out! The single thing I miss most about California... I wish the tilt on this were not so extreme, and that the burger had a little breathing room on the left. Also, there''s an unfortunate tangence between the rim of the cup and the top of the divider that could have been avoided to great benefit. The color balance and tones are spot-on, and that wasn''t easy to do. It''s crisp and dynamic, which is good. Goof luck with it, I like it!', '2006-12-13 01:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3111425, 437842, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love the processing here, myself, takes it into a whole different category. Will the voters? Who knows? Thumbs up from me.</td>', 'I love the processing here, myself, takes it into a whole different category. Will the voters? Who knows? Thumbs up from me.', '2006-12-13 01:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
