(3111440, 437470, 30861, '<td valign="top">That is EERIE, strange PP. It almost has a sense of being a stage set with a B/w backdrop, I expect the vendor to burst into song. Oddly enough I was looking for "my" hotdog vendor to shoot him in a similar scene except a natural backdrop, but he''s folded up for the winter :-)<br/> <br/>Can''t make up my mind to hate it or love it, which is all-in-all a good thing. I think it would work better for me if the reds were a little more muted, but I''m not sure. Arresting image, anyway, and into the 6 group for holding.</td>', 'That is EERIE, strange PP. It almost has a sense of being a stage set with a B/w backdrop, I expect the vendor to burst into song. Oddly enough I was looking for "my" hotdog vendor to shoot him in a similar scene except a natural backdrop, but he''s folded up for the winter :-) Can''t make up my mind to hate it or love it, which is all-in-all a good thing. I think it would work better for me if the reds were a little more muted, but I''m not sure. Arresting image, anyway, and into the 6 group for holding.', '2006-12-13 01:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
