(3112010, 437470, 53147, '<td valign="top">This was the first image to come up for me to vote on and let me tell you that you sure set the bar high IMO. The selective desat works great. It gives a wonderful contrast between the chill of outside and the warmth that the hot dog cart spreads out. Very well done - bumping up to a 9 for now - but I might be back again. OK - back real quick to add this to my faves.</td>', 'This was the first image to come up for me to vote on and let me tell you that you sure set the bar high IMO. The selective desat works great. It gives a wonderful contrast between the chill of outside and the warmth that the hot dog cart spreads out. Very well done - bumping up to a 9 for now - but I might be back again. OK - back real quick to add this to my faves.', '2006-12-13 07:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
