(3113121, 437719, 22748, '<td valign="top">Is there black smoke in the foreground? Or some dodge/burn marks? It looks like black smudges and it is kind of distracting.</td>', 'Is there black smoke in the foreground? Or some dodge/burn marks? It looks like black smudges and it is kind of distracting.', '2006-12-13 12:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113130, 436460, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome sunburst. Very impressive.</td>', 'Awesome sunburst. Very impressive.', '2006-12-13 12:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113149, 436494, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool! This is almost unreal. Are the colors natural, infrared, or created in post? I love how the tree forms a frame for the image.</td>', 'Cool! This is almost unreal. Are the colors natural, infrared, or created in post? I love how the tree forms a frame for the image.', '2006-12-13 12:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113158, 438023, 22748, '<td valign="top">The dodge/burn halo around the two people is distracting.</td>', 'The dodge/burn halo around the two people is distracting.', '2006-12-13 12:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113220, 438117, 53316, '<td valign="top">Looks like the paper isn''t perfectly level... I know that''s really nitpicky but it stands out in a shot like this. Everything else is really good and you''re still getting a great score from me.</td>', 'Looks like the paper isn''t perfectly level... I know that''s really nitpicky but it stands out in a shot like this. Everything else is really good and you''re still getting a great score from me.', '2006-12-13 12:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113237, 437729, 69183, '<td valign="top">This really didn''t do anything for me - sorry.</td>', 'This really didn''t do anything for me - sorry.', '2006-12-13 12:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113257, 437462, 69183, '<td valign="top">This would be so much more powerful without the reflections in the window. A pity, otherwise a really nice picture.</td>', 'This would be so much more powerful without the reflections in the window. A pity, otherwise a really nice picture.', '2006-12-13 12:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113265, 438009, 69183, '<td valign="top">Badly framed - I can''t see what the people are looking at, and the plant in the middle of the shot is a hindrance. Sorry</td>', 'Badly framed - I can''t see what the people are looking at, and the plant in the middle of the shot is a hindrance. Sorry', '2006-12-13 12:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113271, 437722, 69183, '<td valign="top">The chairs and table look out of focus. I don''t really understand how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'The chairs and table look out of focus. I don''t really understand how it meets the challenge.', '2006-12-13 12:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113277, 437285, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desat. Very nice.</td>', 'Nice use of selective desat. Very nice.', '2006-12-13 12:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113278, 437620, 65498, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but a little washed out towards top left</td>', 'nice shot, but a little washed out towards top left', '2006-12-13 12:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113279, 435951, 69183, '<td valign="top">Didn''t meet challenge - sorry.</td>', 'Didn''t meet challenge - sorry.', '2006-12-13 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113299, 435972, 69183, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the desat. Perhaps a few less highlights left in colour would increase the impact further.</td>', 'Interesting use of the desat. Perhaps a few less highlights left in colour would increase the impact further.', '2006-12-13 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113317, 437961, 69183, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot going on here but no single subject stood out for me. Maybe if one of the two people in the foreground were better lit or a bit closer, it''d have more impact.</td>', 'There''s a lot going on here but no single subject stood out for me. Maybe if one of the two people in the foreground were better lit or a bit closer, it''d have more impact.', '2006-12-13 12:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113327, 436115, 69183, '<td valign="top">This is cool, but could be better framed - the main sign is cut off to the right and is out of focus, and the "Final Days" sign may be better if it was cropped out.</td>', 'This is cool, but could be better framed - the main sign is cut off to the right and is out of focus, and the "Final Days" sign may be better if it was cropped out.', '2006-12-13 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113347, 436494, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, didn''t understand how it meets the challenga</td>', 'Nice photo, didn''t understand how it meets the challenga', '2006-12-13 13:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113349, 438009, 32749, '<td valign="top">I find the composition of this photo confusing and messy. I am not sure where the focus is. The focus should be on the plants and cows, and with a narrower depth of field  would have achieved this. For the composition I would have moved further round to the left. I hope these are helpful comments.</td>', 'I find the composition of this photo confusing and messy. I am not sure where the focus is. The focus should be on the plants and cows, and with a narrower depth of field  would have achieved this. For the composition I would have moved further round to the left. I hope these are helpful comments.', '2006-12-13 13:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113350, 437800, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but did not meet challenge</td>', 'Nice photo, but did not meet challenge', '2006-12-13 13:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113354, 438047, 69183, '<td valign="top">This got a laugh. Nice one.</td>', 'This got a laugh. Nice one.', '2006-12-13 13:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113361, 437796, 69183, '<td valign="top">Very cool colours, but a pity that the people are so dark.</td>', 'Very cool colours, but a pity that the people are so dark.', '2006-12-13 13:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
