(3114984, 436492, 27399, '<td valign="top">great idea and execution.  your framing made this shot.  just the woman and a few rows of books would not due, but you create a seemingly endless supply of books/products.  the lighting and temperature of the light is obviously difficult to control in that book store environment, could be better with more saturation in the foreground.  you should be proud of this shot, my number 1 in the challenge.</td>', 'great idea and execution.  your framing made this shot.  just the woman and a few rows of books would not due, but you create a seemingly endless supply of books/products.  the lighting and temperature of the light is obviously difficult to control in that book store environment, could be better with more saturation in the foreground.  you should be proud of this shot, my number 1 in the challenge.', '2006-12-13 19:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
