(3115474, 437739, 30049, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder if this lady is a shopper or a worker?  Great detail and clarity in this photo.  Wonderfully captured story here.</td>', 'I have to wonder if this lady is a shopper or a worker?  Great detail and clarity in this photo.  Wonderfully captured story here.', '2006-12-13 22:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115487, 437514, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a unique entry.  I''d have been tempted to go straight B/W with this as there isn''t much color to begin with.  Little vignetting (burn in the corners), and some detailed dodging on the 1 3 2 ($1.32) numbers would help show them better.  Just a thought.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a unique entry.  I''d have been tempted to go straight B/W with this as there isn''t much color to begin with.  Little vignetting (burn in the corners), and some detailed dodging on the 1 3 2 ($1.32) numbers would help show them better.  Just a thought.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-13 22:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115500, 437778, 30049, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you did here.  The items on the table are all quite noisy/grainy like they were underexposed and brought back in post-processing - or - the whole thing was noisy and you ran noise reduction on the people and background?  Just an observation.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you did here.  The items on the table are all quite noisy/grainy like they were underexposed and brought back in post-processing - or - the whole thing was noisy and you ran noise reduction on the people and background?  Just an observation.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-13 22:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3115572, 437842, 54172, '<td valign="top">Very nice and peaceful. Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Very nice and peaceful. Beautiful colors.', '2006-12-13 22:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
