(3116063, 437285, 47316, '<td valign="top">Not sure about your choice of selective desat. I know what you were going for but it looks odd. Perhaps it you had only partially desated the rest?</td>', 'Not sure about your choice of selective desat. I know what you were going for but it looks odd. Perhaps it you had only partially desated the rest?', '2006-12-14 01:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
