(3116317, 438117, 61191, '<td valign="top">Good shot but I don''t get the thing with the white card in your hands... is it white so that people can write something onto it when they buy this shot? Ok, perhaps you laugh at me know because of my strange idea ;)</td>', 'Good shot but I don''t get the thing with the white card in your hands... is it white so that people can write something onto it when they buy this shot? Ok, perhaps you laugh at me know because of my strange idea ;)', '2006-12-14 05:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116405, 437739, 53147, '<td valign="top">These are the types of images I had in mind when I suggested this challenge. I liek this alot - a great find, wonderful colors, sharp detail and a wonderful model. She reminds me of my motherinlaw (who is from the Ukraine). Well done and bumping up 2 to a 9.</td>', 'These are the types of images I had in mind when I suggested this challenge. I liek this alot - a great find, wonderful colors, sharp detail and a wonderful model. She reminds me of my motherinlaw (who is from the Ukraine). Well done and bumping up 2 to a 9.', '2006-12-14 07:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116409, 437906, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great capture. This reminds me of alot of work by e301. This has a wonderful feel to it and the b&amp;w treatment was a great choice. bumping up.</td>', 'Great capture. This reminds me of alot of work by e301. This has a wonderful feel to it and the b&w treatment was a great choice. bumping up.', '2006-12-14 07:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116423, 437627, 24454, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain why, but something about this really appeals to me.    It''s simple, but made interesting by the complimenting framing, and the layout of similar objects in different shapes.   I really like it!</td>', 'I can''t explain why, but something about this really appeals to me.    It''s simple, but made interesting by the complimenting framing, and the layout of similar objects in different shapes.   I really like it!', '2006-12-14 07:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116477, 438086, 48732, '<td valign="top">Like the picture just wish the colors were more vivid.</td>', 'Like the picture just wish the colors were more vivid.', '2006-12-14 08:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116498, 437174, 68256, '<td valign="top">Too OOF and as a personal choice I don''t like leaning buildings.</td>', 'Too OOF and as a personal choice I don''t like leaning buildings.', '2006-12-14 08:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116504, 436171, 68256, '<td valign="top">Best one yet, but the dangling feet disturb me!  That turkey is kinda odd looking too, I guess because of the bright light behind its neck.  Lighting works for me and good clarity.  I keep wanting to check out all the items in the store so good job on that...I think the TV is very funny too...can''t tell what is on though.</td>', 'Best one yet, but the dangling feet disturb me!  That turkey is kinda odd looking too, I guess because of the bright light behind its neck.  Lighting works for me and good clarity.  I keep wanting to check out all the items in the store so good job on that...I think the TV is very funny too...can''t tell what is on though.', '2006-12-14 08:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116512, 437862, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great colors and texture....good job!  The extra saturation works on this (for me).</td>', 'Great colors and texture....good job!  The extra saturation works on this (for me).', '2006-12-14 08:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116518, 437778, 68256, '<td valign="top">wow, now that is some saturation....to much for me though.</td>', 'wow, now that is some saturation....to much for me though.', '2006-12-14 08:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
