(3116527, 436406, 68256, '<td valign="top">Other goods...hah hah....good job.  I think the contrast and hard lines create excelent "feel".</td>', 'Other goods...hah hah....good job.  I think the contrast and hard lines create excelent "feel".', '2006-12-14 08:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116533, 438097, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very funny, I love her expression..I like the cropping too.</td>', 'Very funny, I love her expression..I like the cropping too.', '2006-12-14 08:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116534, 437174, 48982, '<td valign="top">I wonder about doing this with a different color balance setting to get a little less overwhelming orange to the image?  The "lean" of the building makes it feel very dynamic.</td>', 'I wonder about doing this with a different color balance setting to get a little less overwhelming orange to the image?  The "lean" of the building makes it feel very dynamic.', '2006-12-14 08:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116538, 437655, 68256, '<td valign="top">Not for sale?</td>', 'Not for sale?', '2006-12-14 08:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116544, 436460, 48982, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you added the "holy flare."  I feel that might be overstating it.  The juxtaposition alone may have gotten it done for you.  Perhaps shooting it early morning or late evening to get that strong quality of light?</td>', 'I''m assuming you added the "holy flare."  I feel that might be overstating it.  The juxtaposition alone may have gotten it done for you.  Perhaps shooting it early morning or late evening to get that strong quality of light?', '2006-12-14 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
