(3116961, 436951, 58610, '<td valign="top">I''d like a tighter crop on the left. I don''t think the cactus or shops add anything to the photo. I like your colors and the vertical nature of the shot. I think  you could legally clone out those wires up on the roof for a cleaner look, though you''d want to read the rules carefully first.</td>', 'I''d like a tighter crop on the left. I don''t think the cactus or shops add anything to the photo. I like your colors and the vertical nature of the shot. I think  you could legally clone out those wires up on the roof for a cleaner look, though you''d want to read the rules carefully first.', '2006-12-14 11:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116971, 438006, 58610, '<td valign="top">Very interesting juxtaposition of East and West. Is the sign to be taken at face value or is there cynicism at work here? Lots of great content. Black and white works well to underscore the "black and white" nature of religion.</td>', 'Very interesting juxtaposition of East and West. Is the sign to be taken at face value or is there cynicism at work here? Lots of great content. Black and white works well to underscore the "black and white" nature of religion.', '2006-12-14 11:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
