(3117075, 435951, 58610, '<td valign="top">Really? All good looking. And shapely. A closer crop to the elbow on the left would balance this better. And, since this is Advanced Editing, you probably could have cloned out the branch over their heads to clean up the background, but read the rules carefully first. I like the shot otherwise.</td>', 'Really? All good looking. And shapely. A closer crop to the elbow on the left would balance this better. And, since this is Advanced Editing, you probably could have cloned out the branch over their heads to clean up the background, but read the rules carefully first. I like the shot otherwise.', '2006-12-14 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117081, 438009, 56502, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like a random snapshot. Moving a bit to the left to capture more of the two people sitting there would have been better I guess. And that way the plant wouldn''t cover most of these funny/strange cows as well.</td>', 'Looks a bit like a random snapshot. Moving a bit to the left to capture more of the two people sitting there would have been better I guess. And that way the plant wouldn''t cover most of these funny/strange cows as well.', '2006-12-14 11:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
