(3117101, 438052, 48982, '<td valign="top">What an unusual image.  I like the diagonal of the door handle and the awning in relation to the tilted heart.  Everything else is so vertical and horizontal.</td>', 'What an unusual image.  I like the diagonal of the door handle and the awning in relation to the tilted heart.  Everything else is so vertical and horizontal.', '2006-12-14 11:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
