(3117104, 437290, 58610, '<td valign="top">Why not crop it right at the fence? It wasn''t needed and it would have created an unusual format enhancing the  building''s shape. Exposure is great. Love all the details inside and the sign is only slightly blown out and doesn''t really distract.</td>', 'Why not crop it right at the fence? It wasn''t needed and it would have created an unusual format enhancing the  building''s shape. Exposure is great. Love all the details inside and the sign is only slightly blown out and doesn''t really distract.', '2006-12-14 11:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
