(3117107, 438086, 48982, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I think because it is so much about shape and color that I would either make the baskets a straight line or an obvious diagonal.  When it''s just a little off it feels like it wasn''t being considered.  Of course, I''m very OCD about these kinds of things.  ; )<br/> <br/>What a great visual moment to catch!</td>', 'Nice image.  I think because it is so much about shape and color that I would either make the baskets a straight line or an obvious diagonal.  When it''s just a little off it feels like it wasn''t being considered.  Of course, I''m very OCD about these kinds of things.  ; ) What a great visual moment to catch!', '2006-12-14 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117108, 436469, 48982, '<td valign="top">very strong form a formal standpoint.  Lots of wonderful repeated shapes and lines.</td>', 'very strong form a formal standpoint.  Lots of wonderful repeated shapes and lines.', '2006-12-14 11:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
