(3117119, 437862, 48982, '<td valign="top">An interesting image.  The lighting and whatever you did in editing make it feel almost like an illustration instead of a photo.  The fanning colors at top center work nicely.</td>', 'An interesting image.  The lighting and whatever you did in editing make it feel almost like an illustration instead of a photo.  The fanning colors at top center work nicely.', '2006-12-14 11:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117120, 438027, 48982, '<td valign="top">I wonder about emphasizing some of the colors instead of the repetition of the tires.  Bonus points for photos dealing with cycling!</td>', 'I wonder about emphasizing some of the colors instead of the repetition of the tires.  Bonus points for photos dealing with cycling!', '2006-12-14 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117121, 436732, 48982, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I love the simplicity of it.  I probably would have gone in and cloned out the reflections in the window to emphasize the simplicity even more.</td>', 'Interesting image.  I love the simplicity of it.  I probably would have gone in and cloned out the reflections in the window to emphasize the simplicity even more.', '2006-12-14 11:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117122, 437905, 48982, '<td valign="top">what an almost surreal image.  Nice light.</td>', 'what an almost surreal image.  Nice light.', '2006-12-14 11:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117124, 435489, 56502, '<td valign="top">A pair of shoes on the floor. Nothing really special to this picture.</td>', 'A pair of shoes on the floor. Nothing really special to this picture.', '2006-12-14 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117126, 435845, 56502, '<td valign="top">Why would one want to? Anyway - Without the caption there is no connection to "sale" visible for me.</td>', 'Why would one want to? Anyway - Without the caption there is no connection to "sale" visible for me.', '2006-12-14 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117162, 437301, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I really like the lighting in this one. 8</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I really like the lighting in this one. 8', '2006-12-14 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117177, 437886, 63163, '<td valign="top">The reflection distracts from the photo.</td>', 'The reflection distracts from the photo.', '2006-12-14 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117190, 437778, 63163, '<td valign="top">The bright colors seem a little over processed and grainy.</td>', 'The bright colors seem a little over processed and grainy.', '2006-12-14 12:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117196, 437734, 63163, '<td valign="top">The colors seem over processed.  The man and buckets seem like they are glowing.</td>', 'The colors seem over processed.  The man and buckets seem like they are glowing.', '2006-12-14 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117205, 437761, 63163, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems to dark, overall pictures is out of focus to me.</td>', 'The lighting seems to dark, overall pictures is out of focus to me.', '2006-12-14 12:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117271, 437301, 58610, '<td valign="top">Highlights are blown out. Colors are good.</td>', 'Highlights are blown out. Colors are good.', '2006-12-14 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117286, 438027, 58610, '<td valign="top">Interesting border treatment. Kind of gives it a cinemagraphic feeling. Shallow dof keeps it from being too busy, but I might have chosen to focus point a little further down the line.</td>', 'Interesting border treatment. Kind of gives it a cinemagraphic feeling. Shallow dof keeps it from being too busy, but I might have chosen to focus point a little further down the line.', '2006-12-14 12:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117290, 437739, 58610, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful portrait. Lots of character, texture and very deep tones. One of the best so far. 8</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful portrait. Lots of character, texture and very deep tones. One of the best so far. 8', '2006-12-14 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117323, 437905, 58610, '<td valign="top">He feels a little crowded on the left. Really like the b&amp;w conversion - gives us the sense of an earlier time. A white border would really add to that, I think. Nice job burning in the corners to shrink the space.</td>', 'He feels a little crowded on the left. Really like the b&w conversion - gives us the sense of an earlier time. A white border would really add to that, I think. Nice job burning in the corners to shrink the space.', '2006-12-14 12:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117330, 438079, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The juxtaposition of the two cars is great. Good crop and exposure.</td>', 'Nice composition. The juxtaposition of the two cars is great. Good crop and exposure.', '2006-12-14 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117340, 438133, 58610, '<td valign="top">Too busy overall. You could have cropped much closer into the upper left corner and gotten a much cleaner effect.</td>', 'Too busy overall. You could have cropped much closer into the upper left corner and gotten a much cleaner effect.', '2006-12-14 12:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117359, 437454, 58610, '<td valign="top">This has an old world feel because of the b&amp;w conversion, but I wish you hadn''t cropped out the base of the gift shop. I''d have liked the sidewalk to coninue on a little further.</td>', 'This has an old world feel because of the b&w conversion, but I wish you hadn''t cropped out the base of the gift shop. I''d have liked the sidewalk to coninue on a little further.', '2006-12-14 13:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117415, 435951, 50208, '<td valign="top">hahaha good idea, 8 for humor</td>', 'hahaha good idea, 8 for humor', '2006-12-14 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117417, 436492, 50208, '<td valign="top">very nice angle, and the lady makes the photo not as busy, ties it together. 8</td>', 'very nice angle, and the lady makes the photo not as busy, ties it together. 8', '2006-12-14 13:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117418, 437285, 58610, '<td valign="top">Is there a message in the cropped head? Perhaps that loss of individuality is what''s really happening here? Good choice on the desat- graphically draws attention to the tatoos</td>', 'Is there a message in the cropped head? Perhaps that loss of individuality is what''s really happening here? Good choice on the desat- graphically draws attention to the tatoos', '2006-12-14 13:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117424, 437505, 50208, '<td valign="top">perhaps if there were more focus on the diamonds the ring would stand out more, pretty bokeh though!</td>', 'perhaps if there were more focus on the diamonds the ring would stand out more, pretty bokeh though!', '2006-12-14 13:16:32.000000', NULL, 1);
