(3117478, 437643, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Good tonal range.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Good tonal range.', '2006-12-14 13:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117482, 437906, 25203, '<td valign="top">My only problem with this image is that it dose not speak to the challenge with out the title and then I really can''t see the connection... Could be any foray. Good BW though; only if you took one step to the right to square up the background.</td>', 'My only problem with this image is that it dose not speak to the challenge with out the title and then I really can''t see the connection... Could be any foray. Good BW though; only if you took one step to the right to square up the background.', '2006-12-14 13:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117494, 437703, 58610, '<td valign="top">Even though the challenge is "for sale", I think the subject here are the two men and therefore the focus should be sharply on them. Your''s is just in front on the carafs.</td>', 'Even though the challenge is "for sale", I think the subject here are the two men and therefore the focus should be sharply on them. Your''s is just in front on the carafs.', '2006-12-14 13:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117501, 438006, 25203, '<td valign="top">Good image although I don''t agree with the message.  The lack of controlled contrast is throwing me off though.  This is a great image to shoot in color and then use PS Raw or PS color control to change the luminance of a few colors and then convert to BW.  The robes for example, say they''re light blue, selectively make light blue darker and presto I would be more drawn to that part of the image.</td>', 'Good image although I don''t agree with the message.  The lack of controlled contrast is throwing me off though.  This is a great image to shoot in color and then use PS Raw or PS color control to change the luminance of a few colors and then convert to BW.  The robes for example, say they''re light blue, selectively make light blue darker and presto I would be more drawn to that part of the image.', '2006-12-14 13:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117520, 438086, 57842, '<td valign="top">Great Capture, very relevant to the theme, and I like the crop. Only nitpick is that the green pepper is side facing, whereas just about all the others are top facing. But nice spot otherwise.</td>', 'Great Capture, very relevant to the theme, and I like the crop. Only nitpick is that the green pepper is side facing, whereas just about all the others are top facing. But nice spot otherwise.', '2006-12-14 13:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117872, 438086, 68059, '<td valign="top">Love the peppers - just think of the work that goes into piling these guys up.  Would have skipped the baskets and made the odd pepper out the center of attention.  Give it 8, though.</td>', 'Love the peppers - just think of the work that goes into piling these guys up.  Would have skipped the baskets and made the odd pepper out the center of attention.  Give it 8, though.', '2006-12-14 16:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117878, 437234, 68059, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite see the connection with the competition.  The photo would benefit from cropping the structures on the right.  The photo also seems tilted.</td>', 'I don''t quite see the connection with the competition.  The photo would benefit from cropping the structures on the right.  The photo also seems tilted.', '2006-12-14 16:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117881, 438003, 68059, '<td valign="top">The structures (carpets) in front are too dark and disturbing.  Try dodging those slightly.</td>', 'The structures (carpets) in front are too dark and disturbing.  Try dodging those slightly.', '2006-12-14 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117884, 437979, 68059, '<td valign="top">The structure (?mountain) up to the left is slightly disturbing.  The lighting is not optimal, but I love the composition and you definitely have an eye for interesting patterns</td>', 'The structure (?mountain) up to the left is slightly disturbing.  The lighting is not optimal, but I love the composition and you definitely have an eye for interesting patterns', '2006-12-14 16:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
