(3121123, 438033, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors :: Love the staggered feel here :: Might have benefitted from burning those window stickers/sheets :: Great reflections - brings details to the image :: Love the title &lt;&lt;8&gt;&gt;</td>', 'Very nice colors :: Love the staggered feel here :: Might have benefitted from burning those window stickers/sheets :: Great reflections - brings details to the image :: Love the title <<8>>', '2006-12-15 14:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
