(3121150, 437749, 67841, '<td valign="top">Posting brought out a nice texture - image is nice &amp; crisp with great tones :: Magazine could have benefitted from some dodging, IMHO :: Nice overall &lt;&lt;8&gt;&gt;</td>', 'Posting brought out a nice texture - image is nice & crisp with great tones :: Magazine could have benefitted from some dodging, IMHO :: Nice overall <<8>>', '2006-12-15 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121164, 437649, 62095, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot.', '2006-12-15 14:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121168, 437514, 54728, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m impressed.  Very simple and effective.  The detail and clarity are good on the gas pump in the foreground, and the background is also interesting.  Cropping the side off the gas pump is not what I would have done, but you took a risk and it looks good!</td>', 'Wow, I''m impressed.  Very simple and effective.  The detail and clarity are good on the gas pump in the foreground, and the background is also interesting.  Cropping the side off the gas pump is not what I would have done, but you took a risk and it looks good!', '2006-12-15 14:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121174, 436022, 54728, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this photo.  But I think better lighting would have improved it.  There are overexposed parts on the artists face.  Nice paintings though.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this photo.  But I think better lighting would have improved it.  There are overexposed parts on the artists face.  Nice paintings though.', '2006-12-15 14:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121176, 436494, 67841, '<td valign="top">Interesting  - though I''m left wondering exactly what is for sale here :: The tree has such lovely texture that I wish the image had more contrast to show that off :: Nice IR, but ultimately both the lady &amp; the lamb fail to stand out enough, IMO &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Interesting  - though I''m left wondering exactly what is for sale here :: The tree has such lovely texture that I wish the image had more contrast to show that off :: Nice IR, but ultimately both the lady & the lamb fail to stand out enough, IMO << 6 >>', '2006-12-15 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121183, 438023, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, but obvious dodging is a pet peeve of mine - the halo around those two is quite unflattering to the image.</td>', 'Nice angle, but obvious dodging is a pet peeve of mine - the halo around those two is quite unflattering to the image.', '2006-12-15 14:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121187, 437761, 54728, '<td valign="top">The image is nice, but here''s a few suggestions.  If you could get a clearer focus on the flowers (even if the price sign has to be less clear) that would make the whole photo seems less blurred.  <br/>Also, the yellow-orange tone seems to dull the photo.  Instead of making the red flowers stand out, the whole thing, from the ceiling tiles to the counter is orange coloured and this detracts from the flowers.  You could edit the photo in post-processing to make the rest of the image have a less orange tone.  <br/>That being said, I think the composition is interesting.  I''m curious, what language is that on the sign?</td>', 'The image is nice, but here''s a few suggestions.  If you could get a clearer focus on the flowers (even if the price sign has to be less clear) that would make the whole photo seems less blurred.  Also, the yellow-orange tone seems to dull the photo.  Instead of making the red flowers stand out, the whole thing, from the ceiling tiles to the counter is orange coloured and this detracts from the flowers.  You could edit the photo in post-processing to make the rest of the image have a less orange tone.  That being said, I think the composition is interesting.  I''m curious, what language is that on the sign?', '2006-12-15 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121189, 437624, 54728, '<td valign="top">Interesting textured walls.  Nice find and good composition.</td>', 'Interesting textured walls.  Nice find and good composition.', '2006-12-15 14:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121190, 437800, 54728, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Nice trick and very artsy.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Nice trick and very artsy.', '2006-12-15 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121193, 436469, 54728, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like this view.  The strings of lights pull our focus inward to the top of the structure and all the balconies reinforce that.  Great perspective and very clear image too.</td>', 'Wow, I like this view.  The strings of lights pull our focus inward to the top of the structure and all the balconies reinforce that.  Great perspective and very clear image too.', '2006-12-15 14:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121199, 438006, 54728, '<td valign="top">Wow, though this image is not techically perfect(a bit blurry in parts), it packs a punch!.  Nice catch.  The expression on her face is interesting, and it looks like her hands are imitating those of the saints on the poster.</td>', 'Wow, though this image is not techically perfect(a bit blurry in parts), it packs a punch!.  Nice catch.  The expression on her face is interesting, and it looks like her hands are imitating those of the saints on the poster.', '2006-12-15 14:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121201, 436826, 54728, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desaturation!</td>', 'Nice use of selective desaturation!', '2006-12-15 14:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121203, 437964, 54728, '<td valign="top">Good job, very clearly focused.</td>', 'Good job, very clearly focused.', '2006-12-15 14:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121207, 437187, 67841, '<td valign="top">What a great image &amp; title, reminds me of my trips to Peru. I so wish the seller had more punch - a little sharper/more in focus than what we have here.  Exposure seems to be under for him &amp; over for the items forcing my eye to disregard either as important to the composition.  I also feel an opportunity was missed to pull some great tones &amp; textures out of this image in post, which may have eliminated the exposure conundrum.  Still, I admire the intention &amp; concept here!  &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'What a great image & title, reminds me of my trips to Peru. I so wish the seller had more punch - a little sharper/more in focus than what we have here.  Exposure seems to be under for him & over for the items forcing my eye to disregard either as important to the composition.  I also feel an opportunity was missed to pull some great tones & textures out of this image in post, which may have eliminated the exposure conundrum.  Still, I admire the intention & concept here!  << 8 >>', '2006-12-15 14:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121209, 435845, 60865, '<td valign="top">I hate guns and think they should be illegal.</td>', 'I hate guns and think they should be illegal.', '2006-12-15 14:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121210, 436030, 54728, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but perhaps not technically perfect.  It looks too much like a snapshot.  The crop is close to the top of his head, the angle is low and tilted.</td>', 'Interesting image, but perhaps not technically perfect.  It looks too much like a snapshot.  The crop is close to the top of his head, the angle is low and tilted.', '2006-12-15 14:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121211, 436258, 54728, '<td valign="top">Nice, full of emotion and action. Not too blurry, considering he was playing the guitar.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice, full of emotion and action. Not too blurry, considering he was playing the guitar.  Good job.', '2006-12-15 14:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
