(3122388, 437998, 60915, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea, well done. I would have liked it dirty''d up a bit to give it a bit more of the sleazy back alley salesman feel, but that''s just me: ) Nice job!</td>', 'This is an excellent idea, well done. I would have liked it dirty''d up a bit to give it a bit more of the sleazy back alley salesman feel, but that''s just me: ) Nice job!', '2006-12-15 21:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122391, 437979, 60915, '<td valign="top">Are these those wheels on the irrigation systems? Anyway, I like the repetition and the contrast, great shot!</td>', 'Are these those wheels on the irrigation systems? Anyway, I like the repetition and the contrast, great shot!', '2006-12-15 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122394, 437842, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great nostalgic feel achieved with the soft focus. very nice.</td>', 'Great nostalgic feel achieved with the soft focus. very nice.', '2006-12-15 21:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122412, 437620, 60915, '<td valign="top">So much interesting stuff to look at in the shot, I love it! I like the plate price tags and the hose across the path waiting for someone to trip over it. I''m surprised that the guy on the crutch made it through. Bumping up</td>', 'So much interesting stuff to look at in the shot, I love it! I like the plate price tags and the hose across the path waiting for someone to trip over it. I''m surprised that the guy on the crutch made it through. Bumping up', '2006-12-15 21:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122483, 437462, 60805, '<td valign="top">lighting seems harsh lot of overexposure, but i understand u had no control over the environment. Nice composition though</td>', 'lighting seems harsh lot of overexposure, but i understand u had no control over the environment. Nice composition though', '2006-12-15 22:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122509, 436494, 31341, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how this meets the challenge?</td>', 'I am not sure how this meets the challenge?', '2006-12-15 22:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122517, 437470, 31341, '<td valign="top">I recognize that street!</td>', 'I recognize that street!', '2006-12-15 22:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122596, 437234, 67258, '<td valign="top">This photo has a great deal of potential, but does need a little editing to maximise its impact.  Most obviously, the sloping horizon needs straightening - this would have the added benefit of showing the boat listing, which would add to the sense of decay and decrepidness.  A bit of an adjustment to levels would also bring the subject out a bit more, but I wouldn''t increase saturation at all - you have got the colours and texture of the rust spot on.  <br/>Doesn''t quite meet my idea of the spirit of the challenge, an so deducting one mark - sorry!</td>', 'This photo has a great deal of potential, but does need a little editing to maximise its impact.  Most obviously, the sloping horizon needs straightening - this would have the added benefit of showing the boat listing, which would add to the sense of decay and decrepidness.  A bit of an adjustment to levels would also bring the subject out a bit more, but I wouldn''t increase saturation at all - you have got the colours and texture of the rust spot on.  Doesn''t quite meet my idea of the spirit of the challenge, an so deducting one mark - sorry!', '2006-12-15 23:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122601, 437777, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perfect depth of field and composition.  For this challenge I would like to have seen some indication or context to show that they were ''for sale'' - even if it was just a tiny price label on a piece of string attached to one of the figures.  Nonetheless, I really like this.</td>', 'Perfect depth of field and composition.  For this challenge I would like to have seen some indication or context to show that they were ''for sale'' - even if it was just a tiny price label on a piece of string attached to one of the figures.  Nonetheless, I really like this.', '2006-12-15 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122606, 437174, 67258, '<td valign="top">Was this hand-held or balanced on something?  Focus is a little soft which makes me think there is some camera shake as the car trails indicate a good long shutter speed.</td>', 'Was this hand-held or balanced on something?  Focus is a little soft which makes me think there is some camera shake as the car trails indicate a good long shutter speed.', '2006-12-15 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122607, 438025, 67258, '<td valign="top">The diagonal slant works well here.</td>', 'The diagonal slant works well here.', '2006-12-15 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122608, 437505, 67258, '<td valign="top">Neat.</td>', 'Neat.', '2006-12-15 23:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122611, 436409, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, the sense of being there watching people going about their business - my eyes just can''t stop looking for new detail!  That said, it is a great shame about the overexposure on part of the vegetable stall, as this would have scored a much higher mark from me otherwise. 6.</td>', 'Love the composition, the sense of being there watching people going about their business - my eyes just can''t stop looking for new detail!  That said, it is a great shame about the overexposure on part of the vegetable stall, as this would have scored a much higher mark from me otherwise. 6.', '2006-12-15 23:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122612, 437853, 67258, '<td valign="top">Focus needs to be a great deal sharper to make the most of the scene.</td>', 'Focus needs to be a great deal sharper to make the most of the scene.', '2006-12-15 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122614, 438006, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super composition, and a wonderful expression on the ''vendor''s face.  I wish focus was sharper on the woman.</td>', 'Super composition, and a wonderful expression on the ''vendor''s face.  I wish focus was sharper on the woman.', '2006-12-15 23:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122615, 436826, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t usualy like partial desaturation, but it does work here.</td>', 'I don''t usualy like partial desaturation, but it does work here.', '2006-12-15 23:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122619, 436391, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but to be pernickety, I wish the paper extended in to the top left hand corner.</td>', 'I like the idea, but to be pernickety, I wish the paper extended in to the top left hand corner.', '2006-12-15 23:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122623, 437800, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title, nor how this fits in with the spirit of the challenge - neat image, though!</td>', 'I don''t understand the title, nor how this fits in with the spirit of the challenge - neat image, though!', '2006-12-15 23:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
