(3122797, 436469, 70000, '<td valign="top">great use of line, i love that the central circle is in not in the center, it gives the picture motion. Nice colors too.</td>', 'great use of line, i love that the central circle is in not in the center, it gives the picture motion. Nice colors too.', '2006-12-16 02:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
