(3123286, 438117, 47852, '<td valign="top">Clever take on the challenge.  I wonder how many people will get it, and how many will just vote it down thinking the guy is selling a blank piece of paper.  The lighting needs to be diffused a tad for my tastes though.</td>', 'Clever take on the challenge.  I wonder how many people will get it, and how many will just vote it down thinking the guy is selling a blank piece of paper.  The lighting needs to be diffused a tad for my tastes though.', '2006-12-16 10:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123294, 437777, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and dof here... those little curly tipped trees in the background add a sense of whimsy to the singers.  But, something about the coloring feels off to me. Perhaps an adjustment of the white balance before taking the shot would have helped.</td>', 'I like the composition and dof here... those little curly tipped trees in the background add a sense of whimsy to the singers.  But, something about the coloring feels off to me. Perhaps an adjustment of the white balance before taking the shot would have helped.', '2006-12-16 10:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
