(3127470, 436409, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. There is a sense of frenzied motion that is very appealing. I am bothered a bit by what looks like slight barrel distortion which, combined with this crop/composition, draws my eye up to the window on the left.</td>', 'I like this shot. There is a sense of frenzied motion that is very appealing. I am bothered a bit by what looks like slight barrel distortion which, combined with this crop/composition, draws my eye up to the window on the left.', '2006-12-18 03:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127473, 438027, 33552, '<td valign="top">Thats a lot of border! I see what you were going for though. Nice concept, but the focus is too much in the foreground IMO. This creates a large amount of "busy, negative space". If the focus was a little deeper in the shot it may be more balanced.</td>', 'Thats a lot of border! I see what you were going for though. Nice concept, but the focus is too much in the foreground IMO. This creates a large amount of "busy, negative space". If the focus was a little deeper in the shot it may be more balanced.', '2006-12-18 03:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127477, 438033, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and wide DoF. The trouble is finding a clear subject. The bright red car competes in form with the rest of the image. An even lower camera angle might get rid of those power lines too.</td>', 'I like the colors and wide DoF. The trouble is finding a clear subject. The bright red car competes in form with the rest of the image. An even lower camera angle might get rid of those power lines too.', '2006-12-18 03:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127488, 437982, 33552, '<td valign="top">The subject here (as implied by your title) is overpowered by the beautiful landscape. Otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'The subject here (as implied by your title) is overpowered by the beautiful landscape. Otherwise a great shot.', '2006-12-18 03:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127490, 437729, 33552, '<td valign="top">Just a couple of suggestions:<br/>Crop just a bit tighter, lose the cord(?) in the BG, a slightly lower camera angle would strenghten your subject, and ease off the contrast just a little.<br/>That said this is a nice shot. BTW, I''m jealous. :)</td>', 'Just a couple of suggestions:Crop just a bit tighter, lose the cord(?) in the BG, a slightly lower camera angle would strenghten your subject, and ease off the contrast just a little.That said this is a nice shot. BTW, I''m jealous. :)', '2006-12-18 03:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127502, 437301, 33552, '<td valign="top">Blown highlights, but thats not too big of a deal. The BG light on the left is really distracting though. It emphasizes the very warm tone. I would either adjust the white balance a bit or desaturate reds a bit or tint the light on the left to match. Nice concept.</td>', 'Blown highlights, but thats not too big of a deal. The BG light on the left is really distracting though. It emphasizes the very warm tone. I would either adjust the white balance a bit or desaturate reds a bit or tint the light on the left to match. Nice concept.', '2006-12-18 03:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127507, 438038, 33552, '<td valign="top">You''re like me. Combining challenges. :) Funky BG, I wonder if it''s just reflections or creative dodging. Neat.</td>', 'You''re like me. Combining challenges. :) Funky BG, I wonder if it''s just reflections or creative dodging. Neat.', '2006-12-18 03:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127516, 437483, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice! I don''t know how to improve on this! I could see this in an ad with the bottom corners extended by cloning and the top accented with a curved graphic (just belos the sprinklers)! 10</td>', 'Very, very nice! I don''t know how to improve on this! I could see this in an ad with the bottom corners extended by cloning and the top accented with a curved graphic (just belos the sprinklers)! 10', '2006-12-18 03:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127520, 437722, 33552, '<td valign="top">This may not make sense, but I feel like I''m going to fall off of the left side of this image. Maybe cropping the left side up to the tree and trimming the top to match would help.</td>', 'This may not make sense, but I feel like I''m going to fall off of the left side of this image. Maybe cropping the left side up to the tree and trimming the top to match would help.', '2006-12-18 03:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127528, 438097, 33552, '<td valign="top">Clean and well composed. The sign and ribbon are just ever so slightly OOF (not too bad though).</td>', 'Clean and well composed. The sign and ribbon are just ever so slightly OOF (not too bad though).', '2006-12-18 03:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127530, 437906, 33552, '<td valign="top">The crop here should match the symmetrical composition. Nice shot, but feels tilted as cropped.</td>', 'The crop here should match the symmetrical composition. Nice shot, but feels tilted as cropped.', '2006-12-18 03:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127534, 437594, 33552, '<td valign="top">Too many straight vertical lines for a tilted composition IMO. A bit disorienting. Nicely exposed though, nice colors.</td>', 'Too many straight vertical lines for a tilted composition IMO. A bit disorienting. Nicely exposed though, nice colors.', '2006-12-18 03:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127538, 437649, 33552, '<td valign="top">There seem to be two photos here. The auto parts and Mr. Od? are competing for attention here. The focus should be one or the other. Creative angle and nice contrast.</td>', 'There seem to be two photos here. The auto parts and Mr. Od? are competing for attention here. The focus should be one or the other. Creative angle and nice contrast.', '2006-12-18 04:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127539, 437862, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and an interesting angle. It could be just a bit brighter, an easy fix in post.</td>', 'Nice colors and an interesting angle. It could be just a bit brighter, an easy fix in post.', '2006-12-18 04:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3127540, 435845, 33552, '<td valign="top">I disagree, but I can''t fault the photo. Could be brightened a bit in levels or curves.</td>', 'I disagree, but I can''t fault the photo. Could be brightened a bit in levels or curves.', '2006-12-18 04:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
