(3133749, 437486, 44099, '<td valign="top">Woohoo! 19th place and 84th percentile. Didn''t break 6 as I had hoped but I still think I did very well with this contest. Thanks for all the votes and comments guys, it looks like I''m starting to really get in my groove!</td>', 'Woohoo! 19th place and 84th percentile. Didn''t break 6 as I had hoped but I still think I did very well with this contest. Thanks for all the votes and comments guys, it looks like I''m starting to really get in my groove!', '2006-12-20 01:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
