(3133766, 436494, 31299, '<td valign="top">Wow... I really got various comments for this picture. Really appreciated all the feedback.<br/> <br/>For people who''s wondering, yes, this lady is selling her lambs at this park because she can also feed them for free. She has about 10 of them. I can understand now that it''s probaby too odd for some people ... <br/> <br/>Why IR? Because the place is mighty hot &amp; sunny, that I figured it would look best in IR. Also the tree bark is kinda unusual. Not much post processing, this is taken using an IR filter.<br/> <br/>Thanks again, and for me ... never stop learning.</td>', 'Wow... I really got various comments for this picture. Really appreciated all the feedback. For people who''s wondering, yes, this lady is selling her lambs at this park because she can also feed them for free. She has about 10 of them. I can understand now that it''s probaby too odd for some people ...  Why IR? Because the place is mighty hot & sunny, that I figured it would look best in IR. Also the tree bark is kinda unusual. Not much post processing, this is taken using an IR filter. Thanks again, and for me ... never stop learning.', '2006-12-20 01:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3133791, 437842, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge! While I really like the look of the photo I have to agree with smardaz in that the look is too cheerful given the somber message. Unless you''re saying it''s a good thing these shops go away. :P That said this shot certainly has the quality to do well just didn''t hit the perfect storm.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge! While I really like the look of the photo I have to agree with smardaz in that the look is too cheerful given the somber message. Unless you''re saying it''s a good thing these shops go away. :P That said this shot certainly has the quality to do well just didn''t hit the perfect storm.', '2006-12-20 01:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
