(3133986, 436030, 66201, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and votes. Placed far better than I expected. This was an experiment with the vignetting ... not sure I like the look myself, but I have to try it out a few times to say "been there, got the T-shirt"...<br/> <br/>I kept the huge Caltex petrol sign in on the right to orientate the seller...contextualise him. I agree the top crop is too tight. Just struggled generally with how to crop for this one. I had 3 shots of him and then the traffic light changed and I had to move on. It was shot from my car window and I had to be quick. <br/> <br/>He is selling bunches of flowers: they''re made from wire and then trheaded with beads. <br/> <br/>But generally pleased with the result and votes.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and votes. Placed far better than I expected. This was an experiment with the vignetting ... not sure I like the look myself, but I have to try it out a few times to say "been there, got the T-shirt"... I kept the huge Caltex petrol sign in on the right to orientate the seller...contextualise him. I agree the top crop is too tight. Just struggled generally with how to crop for this one. I had 3 shots of him and then the traffic light changed and I had to move on. It was shot from my car window and I had to be quick.  He is selling bunches of flowers: they''re made from wire and then trheaded with beads.  But generally pleased with the result and votes.', '2006-12-20 02:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
