(3141953, 438086, 554, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiterook:</b></div><hr/><i> what is the different this picture and the washer machine?  I don''t see no differnt in both shots! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have no idea either,other than this was a 3 and the other was a 2 to me.   Why would anyone want to display this photo?<br/>Guess I''m just not artsy enough.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-22 11:28:25.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by whiterook: what is the different this picture and the washer machine?  I don''t see no differnt in both shots!   I have no idea either,other than this was a 3 and the other was a 2 to me.   Why would anyone want to display this photo?Guess I''m just not artsy enough.', '2006-12-22 11:26:35.000000', '2006-12-22 11:28:25.000000', 0),
(3142012, 438086, 43309, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by David Ey:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiterook:</b></div><hr/><i> what is the different this picture and the washer machine?  I don''t see no differnt in both shots! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have no idea either,other than this was a 3 and the other was a 2 to me.   Why would anyone want to display this photo?<br/>Guess I''m just not artsy enough. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sad that you really don''t see a difference, but to each their own, I guess.<br/> <br/>Thanks to everybody for all the comments, even negative ones (so long as there''s a point; "could do better" isn''t really helpful, whereas "don''t like the contrast, maybe you should''ve..." is). Thanks again for my first ribbon! Very exciting!</td>', 'Originally posted by David Ey: Originally posted by whiterook: what is the different this picture and the washer machine?  I don''t see no differnt in both shots!   I have no idea either,other than this was a 3 and the other was a 2 to me.   Why would anyone want to display this photo?Guess I''m just not artsy enough.   Sad that you really don''t see a difference, but to each their own, I guess. Thanks to everybody for all the comments, even negative ones (so long as there''s a point; "could do better" isn''t really helpful, whereas "don''t like the contrast, maybe you should''ve..." is). Thanks again for my first ribbon! Very exciting!', '2006-12-22 11:56:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3143043, 436826, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne,<br/> <br/>Again, congrats on your plus 6 score! I know that was one of your goals for 2007, and you made it with time to spare. Look at that average from the commenters - almost an 8! And a favorite to boot.<br/> <br/>I think this is one of those few instances where selective desat really works, because it has a specific purpose. (Obviously the voters agreed.)I also think your composition is quite good, and the title enhances the photo and helps tell a story.<br/> <br/>The only suggestion I have would be a shorter DOF - I think the photo would be even stronger if the columns and trees in background were not as sharp.<br/> <br/>Great job and a great photo. Go Team Novice!<br/></td>', 'Julianne, Again, congrats on your plus 6 score! I know that was one of your goals for 2007, and you made it with time to spare. Look at that average from the commenters - almost an 8! And a favorite to boot. I think this is one of those few instances where selective desat really works, because it has a specific purpose. (Obviously the voters agreed.)I also think your composition is quite good, and the title enhances the photo and helps tell a story. The only suggestion I have would be a shorter DOF - I think the photo would be even stronger if the columns and trees in background were not as sharp. Great job and a great photo. Go Team Novice!', '2006-12-22 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3143246, 437979, 59276, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BlackNewfs:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m having a difficult time figuring out what your picture is of. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>They are wheels for a wheel line. Used in farmer irrigation.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=440757" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/59276/thumb/440757.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/59276/thumb/440757.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/59276/thumb/440757.jpg"/></a> <br/>cropped from this image<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=440756" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/59276/thumb/440756.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/59276/thumb/440756.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/59276/thumb/440756.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-24 22:21:26.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by BlackNewfs: I''m having a difficult time figuring out what your picture is of.  They are wheels for a wheel line. Used in farmer irrigation. cropped from this image', '2006-12-22 20:06:06.000000', '2006-12-24 22:21:26.000000', 0),
