(3145957, 437739, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect photograph, IMO.  The lighting is perfect everywhere in the shot, the colors as well.  The people captured, both the woman and the man behind, are perfectly placed in the frame.  And probably most importantly, it''s a lovely depiction of everyday life, frozen in time.  Very nice work!</td>', 'This is a perfect photograph, IMO.  The lighting is perfect everywhere in the shot, the colors as well.  The people captured, both the woman and the man behind, are perfectly placed in the frame.  And probably most importantly, it''s a lovely depiction of everyday life, frozen in time.  Very nice work!', '2006-12-24 07:39:33.000000', NULL, 0),
